{"title":"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 19","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A calculator has a squaring key <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/6/b96384957475495d3ca2adc680af8c68959d750b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{x^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"29\" height=\"26\" /> which replaces the current number displayed with its <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Perfect_square\" title=\"Perfect square\">square</a>.  For example, if the display is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/7/997937b91c7122bee83a142930cc2d7f5480f780.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ 3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"72\" height=\"25\" /> and the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/6/b96384957475495d3ca2adc680af8c68959d750b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{x^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"29\" height=\"26\" /> key is depressed, then the display becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/9/b09676a337713d943cf7bf86dadad64c8ca1b3ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ 9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"72\" height=\"25\" />.  If the display reads <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/b/6dbf150124b9bf0c1257fab976c77590729bfa89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"72\" height=\"25\" />, how many times must you depress the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/6/b96384957475495d3ca2adc680af8c68959d750b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{x^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"29\" height=\"26\" /> key to produce a displayed number greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/9/a39b14023c98c943554d150561aacc188c4ce26d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$500$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/e/ceed8ace71ea50e791c76cccd49b2e833324c5d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 4 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 5 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 8 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 9 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 250$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"348\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We just brute force this:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/4/2e4354d8514ee6194d08eb6040aa4dc25235855c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} 2 &amp;\\rightarrow 4 \\\\ &amp;\\rightarrow 16 \\\\ &amp;\\rightarrow 256 \\\\ &amp;\\rightarrow 65536&gt;500  \\end{align*}\" width=\"133\" height=\"87\" />\n</p><p>Clearly we need to press the button <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> times, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/9/d79e0e8ce41b5c08729443bcc258d13ca061ff35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{A}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"24\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bra